bluejetty:00024572:ios.description:
Our app Art Collection Color by Number is an incredible coloring game that will bring you a lot of positive emotions! Immerse yourself in the world of art right now and feel like a real artist!
Advantages of our Art Collection Color by Number:
- Art Collection Color by Number is intended mainly for adults and adolescents, but may be of interest to everyone who loves beautiful pictures, coloring books and coloring by numbers!
- There are a huge number of pictures on various subjects in the app Art Collection Color by Number! Everyone will be able to find the perfect picture for coloring by numbers!
- The more you color, the more pictures you get! Color step by step all categories of pictures!
- Our coloring game is very easy to use! Convenient and intuitive interface!
How to use Art Collection Color by Number:
- Download Art Collection Color by Number in the App Store;
- Select one coloring page for paint by number;
- You need to follow the numbers in coloring area and a special color palette suggests you what color each number corresponds to;
- When you complete a color, the palette will show you have finished it;
- When you complete the previous category the next category will be available to you;
- Share your completed picture with your friends on social networks.
Be creative and express yourself with adult coloring book Art Collection Color by Number!
About our Premium Purchase:
- This in-app Purchase includes removing banner and interstitial advertising; getting daily replenishment of stocks of boosters; the ability to instantly replenish boosters;
- This in-app Purchase is a one-time purchase;
- Payment will be charged to your Apple ID account at the confirmation of purchase;
- Cost - $9,99.
Links to Terms of Service and Privacy Policy can be found below:
Terms of Service: https://abovegames.com/terms-of-service
Privacy Policy: https://abovegames.com/privacy-policy
Coloring has never been so easy, fun and joy! Download Art Collection Color by Number, start to color right now and have fun!

